#14012
The Bronze Room~
Passing through the door, you come across a change in the featureless stone
of the tower. The walls, floor and ceiling of this room are of shimmering
bronze. The near perfect surface is marred by soot, as if the room is 
subjected to fire from time to time. This could be explained by the piles of
ash scattered about the room. You notice blobs of what might have been steel
stuck to the floor, and what looks like charred bones...
~
