#14017
Richly Furnished Chamber~
The stone walls of this room have been brightened up considerably by the 
expensive carpets strewn on the floor, rugs hanging from the walls, and
beautiful furnishings scattered about it. There are plump cushions piled on
the floor, the air smells of incense and you hear the sounds of tinkling 
bells and chimes. There are stands upon which rest silver bowls and golden
dishes, filled with dainty fruits and succulent sweet meats. The chamber 
extends outwards past curtains of glass beads to the east and north, while
a corridor lies to the south.
~
