E
ornate archway~
Looking closely, you see the arch is formed in the likeness of a grinning 
skull. There are two tiny points of light in the eye sockets. They appear to 
follow your movements. You can see no join between the ornate arch and the 
tower, its as if it were all of one piece.
~
E
bronze plaque~
The plaque reads: "Trial of the Initiate"
~
