#14037
An enourmous hall of black marble~
A glimmering floor of gold-veined black marble stretches out before you. It
certainly makes a welcome change from the plain stone of the tower. The 
marble shines as if polished only yesterday. Strangely, you can see no seam
or join in the marble, its as if the whole floor were of a single slab. The
hall continues to the west, south and north, while a wide corridor lies to the
east.
~
