You are in a large stone hall, about the same size as the one at the entrance
to the tower. The stone is of the same smooth, flawless texture as well. A  
wall of black gold-veined marble lies to the east, while you can see a stone
chamber through an archway to the north. The hall itself extends further to
the west and south.
